Top 3 command in cisco
ss: show start
sr: show run
crs: copy run start

en + tab : enable (priveledge mode)
SIIB: show ip int brief
SMAC: show mac address-table
SCN: show cdp neighbor
SIR: show ip router
SPI: show power inline

